[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697588974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2697588974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id":2697588974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gyfDu","user":{"login":"huisedenanhai","id":22026948,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDI2OTQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22026948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai","html_url":"https://github.com/huisedenanhai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T13:28:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T13:28:17Z","body":"The issue still exists in 4.4 stable release.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697588974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697682410","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2697682410","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id":2697682410,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gy13q","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T13:53:38Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T13:53:38Z","body":"CC @stuartcarnie ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697682410/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698683031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2698683031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id":2698683031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g2qKX","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T19:21:09Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T19:21:09Z","body":"The issue is that the example is using some hacks, as these errors are coming from the `RenderingDriver` when it validates the uniform sets. \n\nAs in noted in the [GDScript code](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/blob/31d1c0c1122717b3ad74aeb94255bc38def52747/compute/texture/water_plane/water_plane.gd#L151-L152), it creates 3 uniform set for the same slot `0`:\n\n```gdscript\n        # Even though we're using 3 sets, they are identical, so we're kinda cheating.\n        return rd.uniform_set_create([uniform], shader, 0)\n```\n\nand then rotates them [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/blob/31d1c0c1122717b3ad74aeb94255bc38def52747/compute/texture/water_plane/water_plane.gd#L210-L212)\n\n```gdscript\n        var next_set = texture_sets[with_next_texture]\n        var current_set = texture_sets[(with_next_texture - 1) % 3]\n        var previous_set = texture_sets[(with_next_texture - 2) % 3]\n```\n\nbut binds them to slots 0, 1 and 2 [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/blob/31d1c0c1122717b3ad74aeb94255bc38def52747/compute/texture/water_plane/water_plane.gd#L217-L219):\n\n```gdscript\n        rd.compute_list_bind_uniform_set(compute_list, current_set, 0)\n        rd.compute_list_bind_uniform_set(compute_list, previous_set, 1)\n        rd.compute_list_bind_uniform_set(compute_list, next_set, 2)\n```\n\nAnd as the `RenderingDevice` validation states (it rotates as the next, current and previous change):\n\n```\n  ERROR: Uniforms supplied for set (2):\n  ERROR: Set: 0 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: N Length: 1\n  ERROR: are not the same format as required by the pipeline shader. Pipeline shader requires the following bindings:\n  ERROR: Set: 0 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: N Length: 1\n  ERROR: Set: 1 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: N Length: 1\n  ERROR: Set: 2 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: Y Length: 1\n```\n\nIn this instance, uniform set 2 is incorrect, as it is *Writable: N**, whereas Set:2 expects **Writable: Y**. And we can see in the [`.glsl` source](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/blob/31d1c0c1122717b3ad74aeb94255bc38def52747/compute/texture/water_plane/water_compute.glsl#L8-L10) this is also true:\n\n```glsl\nlayout(r32f, set = 0, binding = 0) uniform restrict readonly image2D current_image;\nlayout(r32f, set = 1, binding = 0) uniform restrict readonly image2D previous_image;\nlayout(r32f, set = 2, binding = 0) uniform restrict writeonly image2D output_image;\n```\n\nNote that slot 0 and 1 are _readonly_ as the log messages state:\n\n```\n  ERROR: Set: 0 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: N Length: 1\n  ERROR: Set: 1 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: N Length: 1\n ```\n\nand slot 2 is _writeonly_ as stated:\n\n```\n  ERROR: Set: 2 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: Y Length: 1\n```\n\nWhen the Metal driver reflects the SPIR-V, it is being more strict apparently.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698683031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698735517","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2698735517","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id":2698735517,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g22-d","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T19:43:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T19:43:22Z","body":"Turns out there is a bug in `RenderingDeviceDriver::_reflect_spirv`:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1af1edf60c1c317f6953c4fa78e0743a0729704d/servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.cpp#L163-L167\n\nWhen reflecting an image type, the `binding.block` struct is _invalid_, as that only applies to `struct` types. Here is the dumped value from the debugger, abbreviated:\n\n```\n{\n  spirv_id = 65\n  name = 0x000000011c28fd80 \"current_image\"\n  binding = 0\n  input_attachment_index = 0\n  set = 0\n  descriptor_type = SPV_REFLECT_DESCRIPTOR_TYPE_STORAGE_IMAGE\n  resource_type = SPV_REFLECT_RESOURCE_FLAG_UAV\n  image = (dim = SpvDim2D, depth = 0, arrayed = 0, ms = 0, sampled = 2, image_format = SpvImageFormatR32f)\n  block = {\n    spirv_id = 0\n    name = 0x0000000000000000\n    offset = 0\n    absolute_offset = 0\n    size = 0\n    padded_size = 0\n    decoration_flags = 0\n    flags = 0\n    member_count = 0\n    members = nullptr\n    type_description = nullptr\n    word_offset = (offset = 0)\n  }\n  count = 1\n  accessed = 1\n  uav_counter_id = 4294967295\n  uav_counter_binding = nullptr\n  byte_address_buffer_offset_count = 0\n  byte_address_buffer_offsets = 0x0000000000000000\n  type_description = 0x000000011c295470\n  word_offset = (binding = 175, set = 171)\n  decoration_flags = 128\n  user_type = SPV_REFLECT_USER_TYPE_INVALID\n}\n```\n\nNote that the `spirv_id` is **0**, and the `binding.block.decoration_flags` is `0`, which means this will evaluate to `true`, as the second part of the expression does not have the `SPV_REFLECT_DECORATION_NON_WRITABLE` bit set, as it is invalid and always `0`:\n\n```cpp\nuniform.writable = !(binding.type_description->decoration_flags & SPV_REFLECT_DECORATION_NON_WRITABLE) && !(binding.block.decoration_flags & SPV_REFLECT_DECORATION_NON_WRITABLE);\n```\n\nMetal has its own implementation to reflect the SPIR-V, which distinguishes the types:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d89cc01e0028e9dff488cdf768f62fdf31b1743e/drivers/metal/rendering_device_driver_metal.mm#L1787-L1796","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698735517/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698753380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2698753380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id":2698753380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g27Vk","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T19:51:54Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T19:51:54Z","body":"If I fix `RenderingDeviceDriver::_reflect_spirv`, then Vulkan produces the same error:\n\n```\nERROR: Uniforms supplied for set (2):\nSet: 0 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: N Length: 1\nare not the same format as required by the pipeline shader. Pipeline shader requires the following bindings:\nSet: 0 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: N Length: 1\nSet: 1 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: N Length: 1\nSet: 2 Binding: 0 Type: Image Writable: Y Length: 1\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698753380/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701322632","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2701322632","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id":2701322632,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hAumI","user":{"login":"huisedenanhai","id":22026948,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDI2OTQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22026948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai","html_url":"https://github.com/huisedenanhai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huisedenanhai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T15:40:05Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T15:40:05Z","body":"But why perform read/write validation for descriptor sets? As far as I know Vulkan does not care readwrite state when creating descriptor sets. Metal might need to specify readwrite state when calling useResoruces, but that seems to be tracked in MDCommandBuffer. There is no need to bake readwrite state in uniform set.\n\nSurely I can modify the sample to create 3 sets for each image (9 sets in total) and make it run on metal without error. But that feels redundent and hints some potential performance issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701322632/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701798000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2701798000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id":2701798000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hCipw","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T18:51:15Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T18:51:15Z","body":"The demo will be fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1174","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701798000/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701804116","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2701804116","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id":2701804116,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hCkJU","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T18:54:04Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T18:54:04Z","body":"> But why perform read/write validation for descriptor sets?\n\nThis isn't about performing read/write validation, it is about verifying the descriptor sets have matching layouts. There was a bug in Godot's default SPIR-V reflection that incorrectly determined whether a uniform was writable, marking them _all_ as writable, so the formats of all 3 uniforms were considered the same. Metal has its own SPIR-V reflection that generated two distinct uniform set layouts, and so Godot's own runtime validation failed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701804116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701805975","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2701805975","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id":2701805975,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hCkmX","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T18:54:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T18:54:58Z","body":"> Surely I can modify the sample to create 3 sets for each image (9 sets in total) and make it run on metal without error. But that feels redundent and hints some potential performance issue.\n\nI modified the sample so all the uniforms are the same. Still only has 3 uniform sets.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701805975/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702237467","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2702237467","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101696","id